OL,3,GNEWSARare condition left new mum
OL,4,Afighting for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who was told she might not
OL,7,Fsurvive emergency surgery to deliver
OL,8,Fher baby said listening to her body
OL,9,Fultimately saved her life.
OL,11,FLucy, from Jersey, was 21-years-old and
OL,12,F26 weeks pregnant when she suddenly
OL,13,Fbegan feeling unwell. She was taken to
OL,14,Fhospital where tests revealed she was
OL,15,Fcritically ill.
