OL,3,GNEWSARare condition left new mum
OL,4,Afighting for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was airlifted to Portsmouth for
OL,7,Femergency surgery to deliver her baby.
OL,8,F"There was a chance I wouldn't wake up
OL,9,Ffrom the surgery," she said. Her
OL,10,Fdaughter was delivered at just 26 weeks
OL,11,Fweighing 1lb 6oz (0.62kg) and kept on a
OL,12,Fventilator for more than three months.
OL,14,FLucy was later diagnosed with
OL,15,Fthrombotic thrombocytopenic purpura
OL,16,F(TTP), a condition which causes
OL,17,Fdangerous blood clots.
